    {
      "sectionId": "conclusion",
      "title": "Conclusion",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "isHtml": true,
          "text": "MongoDB is one of the most powerful and widely used NoSQL databases in modern software development. Its flexible schema, scalability, and cloud-ready architecture make it ideal for web apps, mobile apps, analytics systems, and enterprise applications."
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "isHtml": true,
          "text": "If you want to become a modern full-stack developer or work with scalable cloud applications, learning MongoDB in 2026 is an excellent choice."
        }
      ]
